{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://sovereign-ax.dev/schemas/remote-envelope.schema.json",
  "title": "Sovereign AX Remote Envelope v1.6 (live messages and queued phone-to-PC transfers; plaintext inside Noise transport; binary fields base64 here, CBOR bytes on the wire)",
  "$comment": "v1.3 (AUDIT-B B-10/B-24/B-27/B-29, AUDIT-C C-01/C-06/C-16/C-17/C-20/C-26, re-audit E-10). Live session messages only. Offline intents use intent-envelope.schema.json; 'ttl' here never exceeds 86400 s while intents carry their own 'exp' <= 72 h (C/X-14). Error codes are local-UI only and never sent (C/X-12). Signature contexts: D08 §2.1. v1.4 (2026-11-05, ADR-034, D14 M7-4): Phase 1 phone-to-PC kinds receipt.offer/chunk/ack and cash.entry/ack. Photos travel inline in the live session only (Phase 1 has no blob store; never in the relay queue), 48 KiB chunks, at most 4 MiB per photo. msgId is the stable item id for retransmit and dedup (D07 receipts.phone_msg_id). Also v1.4: AIK-signed objects (deviceListEntry.entry, revoked records, pair.ok cert) are signed over utf8(ctx) || utf8(JCS(object)) per services/shared/CONTRACT.md §1 (lead decision 2026-11-05), not CBOR; pair.ok cert maxLength 512 -> 1024 (JCS form). v1.5 (2026-11-05, lead decision; Phase 1 has no live WSS): when no live session is open, receipt.offer/chunk and cash.entry bodies also travel through the relay HTTPS queue inside intent-envelope v1.5 kind xfer (E2EE HPKE to Q_D, TTL 24 h, deleted on ack). Queued photos use 32 KiB chunks so each chunk is one queue envelope (ct <= 65,536 chars): chunkSize 49152 (live) | 32768 (queue), chunkCount <= 128, index <= 127. Receipt/cash acks are live-only; over the queue the phone keeps the item until a live ack or its keep window ends, and the PC dedupes by msgId. v1.6 (2026-11-06, lead decision, design #120): pair.ok carries acctClaim (account service signature over SAX-acct-claim-v1 || JCS({account_id, email, aik_pub, iat, exp})) and an optional unsigned desktopName; the phone shows the full email and saves only after the user confirms.",
  "type": "object",
  "required": ["v", "type", "id", "pairId", "from", "to", "seq", "ts", "ttl", "body"],
  "unevaluatedProperties": false,
  "properties": {
    "v": {"const": 1},
    "type": {"enum": ["hello", "pair.ok", "kek.grant", "devlist.push", "mbx.reissue", "cmd.run", "cmd.abort", "cmd.resume", "run.event", "gate.request", "gate.response", "consent.request", "consent.response", "human.request", "human.response", "file.offer", "query.documents", "query.result", "rotate.static", "close", "ping", "pong", "receipt.offer", "receipt.chunk", "receipt.ack", "cash.entry", "cash.ack"]},
    "id": {"$ref": "#/$defs/ulid"},
    "pairId": {"$ref": "#/$defs/ulid"},
    "from": {"enum": ["desktop", "mobile"]},
    "to": {"enum": ["desktop", "mobile"]},
    "seq": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0, "maximum": 9007199254740991},
    "ts": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0},
    "ttl": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 5, "maximum": 86400, "$comment": "live messages only (C/X-14)"},
    "replyTo": {"anyOf": [{"$ref": "#/$defs/ulid"}, {"type": "null"}]},
    "body": {"type": "object"}
  },
  "$defs": {
    "ulid": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9A-HJKMNP-TV-Z]{26}$"},
    "uuid4": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-4[0-9a-f]{3}-[89ab][0-9a-f]{3}-[0-9a-f]{12}$", "$comment": "random, no timestamp (C-09)"},
    "stepRef": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^s[0-9]{1,3}[a-z]?$"},
    "b64": {"type": "string", "contentEncoding": "base64"},
    "b64key32": {"type": "string", "contentEncoding": "base64", "minLength": 43, "maxLength": 44},
    "sha256hex": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"},
    "sigAlg": {"enum": ["ed25519", "p256"]},
    "day": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^\\d{4}-(0[1-9]|1[0-2])-(0[1-9]|[12]\\d|3[01])$"},
    "won": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0, "maximum": 100000000000, "$comment": "KRW integer. Never logged."},
    "bizNo": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^\\d{3}-\\d{2}-\\d{5}$"},
    "fieldKey": {
      "$comment": "Closed list (B-24). Card labels come from the app-built-in fieldKey dictionary, never from package strings. Keep in sync with the D02 fieldKey dictionary (H-01 baseline). $first.* and $dup.* are engine-generated reserved keys (first-time counterparty/recipient from the ledger, duplicate warnings), hashed into cardHash (ADR-021). $dup.portalExisting = count of pre-gate baseline (B0) approval numbers unknown to this PC's ledger, Phase 1 on; $dup.otherDevice only for accounts with 2+ desktops, Phase 2 (ADR-024).",
      "enum": ["supplyAmount", "taxAmount", "totalAmount", "counterpartBizNo", "counterpartName", "counterpartEmail", "supplierBizNo", "supplierName", "issueDate", "itemName", "itemCount", "remark", "receiptType", "$first.bizNo", "$first.email", "$dup.businessKey", "$dup.priorNotCommitted", "$dup.otherDevice", "$dup.portalExisting"]
    },
    "effect": {"enum": ["issue_document", "send", "sign", "pay"], "$comment": "same vocabulary as manifest.effects (playbook-ir.schema.json)"},
    "deviceListEntry": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["entry", "aikSig"],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "$comment": "AIK-signed, context SAX-devlist-v1 (C-01). Reject unsigned entries or list_version lower than seen.",
      "properties": {
        "entry": {"type": "object", "required": ["device_id", "role", "Sx", "Vx", "registered_at", "list_version"], "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {
          "device_id": {"$ref": "#/$defs/uuid4"},
          "role": {"enum": ["desktop", "mobile"]},
          "Sx": {"$ref": "#/$defs/b64key32"},
          "Vx": {"$ref": "#/$defs/b64key32"},
          "registered_at": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0},
          "list_version": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1}}},
        "aikSig": {"$ref": "#/$defs/b64", "maxLength": 88}
      }
    },
    "deviceList": {"type": "object", "required": ["listVersion", "entries", "revoked"], "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {
      "listVersion": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1},
      "entries": {"type": "array", "maxItems": 5, "items": {"$ref": "#/$defs/deviceListEntry"}},
      "revoked": {"type": "array", "maxItems": 64, "items": {"type": "object", "required": ["device_id", "revoked_at", "aikSig"], "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"device_id": {"$ref": "#/$defs/uuid4"}, "revoked_at": {"type": "integer"}, "aikSig": {"$ref": "#/$defs/b64", "maxLength": 88}}}}}}
  },
  "allOf": [
    {"if": {"properties": {"type": {"const": "hello"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"body": {"type": "object", "required": ["appVersion", "protocol", "suites", "deviceListVersion", "asyncSeqMax", "registryHeadHash", "capabilities"], "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {
      "appVersion": {"type": "string", "maxLength": 32},
      "protocol": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "$comment": "sessions below policy.remote.minProtocolVersion are closed (D08 §9.8)"},
      "suites": {"type": "array", "minItems": 1, "maxItems": 8, "items": {"enum": ["noise-25519-chachapoly-blake2b", "hpke-x25519-sha256-chachapoly", "xwing-reserved"]}, "$comment": "algorithm identifiers; X-Wing hybrid reserved (C-34)"},
      "deviceListVersion": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0, "$comment": "mismatch => hold irreversible approvals and secret requests until devlist.push applied (C-20)"},
      "asyncSeqMax": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0},
      "registryHeadHash": {"$ref": "#/$defs/sha256hex", "$comment": "registry transparency-log tree head seen by this device; mismatch => warn (C-26 split-view)"},
      "registryTreeSize": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0},
      "capabilities": {"type": "array", "maxItems": 32, "items": {"type": "string", "maxLength": 32}}}}}}},
    {"if": {"properties": {"type": {"const": "pair.ok"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"body": {"type": "object", "required": ["cert", "aikPub", "kvPub", "kvSig", "deviceList", "mbxId", "tokRead", "tokWrite", "mbxEpoch", "acctClaim"], "additionalProperties": false, "$comment": "No KEK here (kek.grant is a separate Hello-confirmed step). mbxId/tokens are 32-byte CSPRNG values, never derived from the handshake hash h (C-16). The phone has no account login: first pairing pins aikPub (TOFU), re-pairing requires the pinned value (C-01, D08 §4.1). v1.6: acctClaim is the account service's signed claim the phone verifies before saving keys (lead decision 2026-11-06, design #120); desktopName is the PC's own name, shown only as a reference.", "properties": {"acctClaim": {"$ref": "#/$defs/b64", "maxLength": 1400, "$comment": "b64(utf8(JCS({claim:{account_id, email, aik_pub, iat, exp}, sig}))). The account service signs utf8(SAX-acct-claim-v1) || utf8(JCS(claim)) with Ed25519; iat/exp are Unix seconds. The phone verifies with its pinned account service key(s), requires exp > now and aik_pub == aikPub, and aborts without saving on any failure."}, "desktopName": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 40, "$comment": "Unsigned; the phone shows it as the name the PC reported."}, 
      "cert": {"$ref": "#/$defs/b64", "maxLength": 1024, "$comment": "b64(utf8(JCS(SignedCert))), SignedCert = {cert:{device_id, role, Sx, Vx, Kx?, Px?, not_after}, aikSig}; AIK signs utf8(SAX-cert-v1) || utf8(JCS(cert)) (services/shared/CONTRACT.md §1). The phone posts SignedCert as-is to POST /v1/device-tokens."},
      "aikPub": {"$ref": "#/$defs/b64key32"},
      "kvPub": {"$ref": "#/$defs/b64key32"},
      "kvSig": {"$ref": "#/$defs/b64", "maxLength": 88},
      "deviceList": {"$ref": "#/$defs/deviceList"},
      "mbxId": {"$ref": "#/$defs/b64key32"},
      "tokRead": {"$ref": "#/$defs/b64key32"},
      "tokWrite": {"$ref": "#/$defs/b64key32"},
      "mbxEpoch": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0}}}}}},
    {"if": {"properties": {"type": {"const": "kek.grant"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"body": {"type": "object", "required": ["kek", "kekVer", "kekRecord"], "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {
      "kek": {"$ref": "#/$defs/b64key32"},
      "kekVer": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1},
      "kekRecord": {"type": "object", "required": ["n", "salt", "createdAt", "aikSig"], "additionalProperties": false, "$comment": "AIK-signed, context SAX-kek-v1 (C-07)", "properties": {"n": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1}, "salt": {"$ref": "#/$defs/b64key32"}, "createdAt": {"type": "integer"}, "aikSig": {"$ref": "#/$defs/b64", "maxLength": 88}}}}}}}},
    {"if": {"properties": {"type": {"const": "devlist.push"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"body": {"type": "object", "required": ["deviceList"], "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"deviceList": {"$ref": "#/$defs/deviceList"}}}}}},
    {"if": {"properties": {"type": {"const": "mbx.reissue"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"body": {"type": "object", "required": ["mbxId", "tokRead", "tokWrite", "mbxEpoch"], "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"mbxId": {"$ref": "#/$defs/b64key32"}, "tokRead": {"$ref": "#/$defs/b64key32"}, "tokWrite": {"$ref": "#/$defs/b64key32"}, "mbxEpoch": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0}}}}}},
    {"if": {"properties": {"type": {"const": "cmd.run"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"body": {"type": "object", "required": ["cmdId", "playbookId", "inputs"], "additionalProperties": false, "$comment": "Live cmd.run is also checked against the persisted set of processed cmdIds (B-10). inputs validated against the playbook input schema; x-secret fields forbidden.", "properties": {"cmdId": {"$ref": "#/$defs/ulid"}, "playbookId": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[a-z0-9]+(\\.[a-z0-9_]+)+$", "maxLength": 80}, "inputs": {"type": "object", "maxProperties": 32}}}}}},
    {"if": {"properties": {"type": {"enum": ["cmd.abort", "cmd.resume"]}}}, "then": {"properties": {"body": {"type": "object", "required": ["runId"], "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"runId": {"$ref": "#/$defs/ulid"}}}}}},
    {"if": {"properties": {"type": {"const": "run.event"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"body": {"type": "object", "required": ["runId", "event", "at"], "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"runId": {"$ref": "#/$defs/ulid"}, "event": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[a-z_.]+$", "maxLength": 40}, "at": {"type": "integer"}, "stepId": {"$ref": "#/$defs/stepRef"}, "code": {"type": "string", "maxLength": 40}, "status": {"type": "string", "maxLength": 32}}}}}},
    {"if": {"properties": {"type": {"const": "gate.request"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"body": {"type": "object", "required": ["runId", "stepId", "reqId", "cardId", "gateKind", "effects", "fields", "cardHashInputs", "actionHash", "requiredSigAlg", "challenge", "exp"], "additionalProperties": false, "$comment": "fields are readback values (B-29). Phone recomputes cardHash from displayed fields and actionHash = SHA-256(CBOR{cardHash, readbackHash, authorizes[], packageDigest, intentId}) (D03 §3) and enables approve only on match. requiredSigAlg = p256 for irreversible effects (C-06). effects is REQUIRED (empty array allowed for start gates) so the p256 rule below cannot be skipped by omitting it (E-10).", "properties": {
      "runId": {"$ref": "#/$defs/ulid"},
      "stepId": {"$ref": "#/$defs/stepRef"},
      "reqId": {"$ref": "#/$defs/ulid"},
      "cardId": {"type": "string", "maxLength": 40},
      "gateKind": {"enum": ["start", "commit"], "$comment": "drained intents: start gate then commit gate (C-17)"},
      "queuedAt": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0, "$comment": "set when the run originates from an offline intent; shown as 'N hours ago'"},
      "effects": {"type": "array", "maxItems": 4, "items": {"$ref": "#/$defs/effect"}},
      "fields": {"type": "array", "maxItems": 24, "items": {"type": "object", "required": ["key", "value"], "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"key": {"$ref": "#/$defs/fieldKey"}, "value": {"type": "string", "maxLength": 200}}}},
      "cardHashInputs": {"type": "object", "required": ["readbackHash", "packageDigest", "authorizes", "intentId"], "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"readbackHash": {"$ref": "#/$defs/sha256hex"}, "packageDigest": {"$ref": "#/$defs/sha256hex"}, "authorizes": {"type": "array", "maxItems": 3, "items": {"$ref": "#/$defs/stepRef"}, "$comment": "same bound as playbook-ir gate.authorizes (V-03i)"}, "intentId": {"$ref": "#/$defs/ulid"}}},
      "actionHash": {"$ref": "#/$defs/sha256hex"},
      "requiredSigAlg": {"$ref": "#/$defs/sigAlg"},
      "challenge": {"$ref": "#/$defs/b64key32"},
      "exp": {"type": "integer"}},
      "allOf": [{"if": {"properties": {"effects": {"contains": {"enum": ["issue_document", "send", "sign", "pay"]}}}}, "then": {"properties": {"requiredSigAlg": {"const": "p256"}}}}, {"if": {"properties": {"gateKind": {"const": "commit"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"effects": {"minItems": 1}}}}]}}}},
    {"if": {"properties": {"type": {"const": "gate.response"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"body": {"type": "object", "required": ["runId", "stepId", "reqId", "decision", "actionHash", "sigAlg", "sig"], "additionalProperties": false, "$comment": "sig = Sign(SAX-approve-v1 || pair_id || reqId || challenge || actionHash || decision). PC rejects sigAlg != requiredSigAlg of the matching gate.request and any reqId already decided (gate_requests).", "properties": {"runId": {"$ref": "#/$defs/ulid"}, "stepId": {"$ref": "#/$defs/stepRef"}, "reqId": {"$ref": "#/$defs/ulid"}, "decision": {"enum": ["approve", "deny"]}, "actionHash": {"$ref": "#/$defs/sha256hex"}, "sigAlg": {"$ref": "#/$defs/sigAlg"}, "sig": {"$ref": "#/$defs/b64", "maxLength": 128}}}}}},
    {"if": {"properties": {"type": {"const": "consent.request"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"body": {"type": "object", "required": ["reqId", "scheduleId", "playbookId", "major", "effects", "docType", "profileRef", "mode", "challenge", "exp"], "additionalProperties": false, "$comment": "Daemon schedule consent (B-27).", "properties": {
      "reqId": {"$ref": "#/$defs/ulid"},
      "scheduleId": {"type": "string", "maxLength": 40},
      "playbookId": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[a-z0-9]+(\\.[a-z0-9_]+)+$", "maxLength": 80},
      "major": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0},
      "effects": {"type": "array", "maxItems": 4, "items": {"$ref": "#/$defs/effect"}},
      "docType": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[a-z_]+$", "maxLength": 40},
      "profileRef": {"type": "string", "maxLength": 40},
      "mode": {"enum": ["notify", "semi_auto", "auto"]},
      "challenge": {"$ref": "#/$defs/b64key32"},
      "exp": {"type": "integer"}}}}}},
    {"if": {"properties": {"type": {"const": "consent.response"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"body": {"type": "object", "required": ["reqId", "decision", "consentHash", "sigAlg", "sig"], "additionalProperties": false, "$comment": "sig = Sign(SAX-consent-v1 || pair_id || reqId || challenge || consentHash || decision). The gate.response verifier never accepts this context.", "properties": {"reqId": {"$ref": "#/$defs/ulid"}, "decision": {"enum": ["consent", "deny"]}, "consentHash": {"$ref": "#/$defs/sha256hex"}, "sigAlg": {"$ref": "#/$defs/sigAlg"}, "sig": {"$ref": "#/$defs/b64", "maxLength": 128}}}}}},
    {"if": {"properties": {"type": {"const": "human.request"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"body": {"type": "object", "required": ["runId", "stepId", "reqId", "kind", "prompt", "ttl"], "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"runId": {"$ref": "#/$defs/ulid"}, "stepId": {"$ref": "#/$defs/stepRef"}, "reqId": {"$ref": "#/$defs/ulid"}, "kind": {"enum": ["captcha", "otp", "secret", "manual"]}, "prompt": {"type": "string", "maxLength": 200}, "imageChunks": {"type": "array", "maxItems": 13, "items": {"$ref": "#/$defs/b64", "maxLength": 21848}}, "imageSha256": {"$ref": "#/$defs/sha256hex"}, "ttl": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 10, "maximum": 600}, "vaultChallenge": {"$ref": "#/$defs/b64", "maxLength": 44}, "origin": {"type": "string", "maxLength": 100}, "secretKind": {"enum": ["cert_password", "portal_password", "security_card"]}},
      "allOf": [{"if": {"properties": {"kind": {"const": "secret"}}}, "then": {"required": ["vaultChallenge", "origin", "secretKind"], "not": {"required": ["imageChunks"]}}}, {"if": {"properties": {"kind": {"const": "captcha"}}}, "then": {"required": ["imageChunks", "imageSha256"]}}]}}}},
    {"if": {"properties": {"type": {"const": "human.response"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"body": {"type": "object", "required": ["runId", "stepId", "reqId"], "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"runId": {"$ref": "#/$defs/ulid"}, "stepId": {"$ref": "#/$defs/stepRef"}, "reqId": {"$ref": "#/$defs/ulid"}, "value": {"type": "string", "maxLength": 64}, "sealed": {"$ref": "#/$defs/b64", "maxLength": 1024}}, "oneOf": [{"required": ["value"]}, {"required": ["sealed"]}]}}}},
    {"if": {"properties": {"type": {"const": "file.offer"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"body": {"type": "object", "required": ["docId", "docType", "bytes", "blobId", "wDEK", "kekVer"], "additionalProperties": false, "$comment": "one document-level wDEK only (C-07)", "properties": {"docId": {"$ref": "#/$defs/uuid4"}, "docType": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[a-z_]+$", "maxLength": 40}, "bytes": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1}, "blobId": {"$ref": "#/$defs/uuid4"}, "wDEK": {"$ref": "#/$defs/b64", "maxLength": 128}, "kekVer": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1}}}}}},
    {"if": {"properties": {"type": {"const": "query.documents"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"body": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"docType": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[a-z_]+$"}, "expiresBefore": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$"}, "limit": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 100}}}}}},
    {"if": {"properties": {"type": {"const": "query.result"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"body": {"type": "object", "required": ["items"], "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"items": {"type": "array", "maxItems": 100, "items": {"type": "object", "required": ["docId", "docType"], "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"docId": {"$ref": "#/$defs/uuid4"}, "docType": {"type": "string"}, "issuedAt": {"type": "string"}, "expiresAt": {"type": "string"}, "displayName": {"type": "string", "maxLength": 80}}}}}}}}},
    {"if": {"properties": {"type": {"const": "rotate.static"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"body": {"type": "object", "required": ["oldStatic", "newStatic", "ts", "sig"], "additionalProperties": false, "$comment": "sig = Sign_Vx(SAX-rotate-v1 || pair_id || from || old_static || new_static || ts). Effective only after the PC re-issues the AIK certificate with user confirmation; all devices notified (C-18).", "properties": {"oldStatic": {"$ref": "#/$defs/b64key32"}, "newStatic": {"$ref": "#/$defs/b64key32"}, "ts": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0}, "sig": {"$ref": "#/$defs/b64", "maxLength": 128}}}}}},
    {"if": {"properties": {"type": {"enum": ["close", "ping", "pong"]}}}, "then": {"properties": {"body": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {}}}}},
    {"if": {"properties": {"type": {"const": "receipt.offer"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"body": {"type": "object", "required": ["msgId", "capturedAt", "mime", "bytes", "sha256", "chunkSize", "chunkCount", "ocrEngine", "ownerConfirmed"], "additionalProperties": false, "$comment": "Paper receipt photo from the in-app camera (P-08). chunkCount must equal ceil(bytes / chunkSize) (checked in code). Phone OCR values are an input aid; the PC docparse sandbox re-read is canonical (ADR-034 decision 9).", "properties": {
      "msgId": {"$ref": "#/$defs/ulid", "$comment": "stable across retransmits; PC stores it as receipts.phone_msg_id (UNIQUE) and acks a known msgId as stored without storing again"},
      "capturedAt": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0},
      "mime": {"const": "image/jpeg"},
      "bytes": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 4194304},
      "sha256": {"$ref": "#/$defs/sha256hex", "$comment": "of the whole JPEG. On mismatch the PC drops the reassembly and asks for every chunk again"},
      "chunkSize": {"enum": [49152, 32768], "$comment": "49152 in a live session, 32768 in the relay queue (v1.5)"},
      "chunkCount": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 128},
      "width": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 8192},
      "height": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 8192},
      "ocrEngine": {"enum": ["ios_vision", "android_mlkit", "none"]},
      "ownerConfirmed": {"type": "boolean"},
      "candidates": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "$comment": "values after the owner check on the phone; PC keeps them in receipts.phone_ocr_json next to its own result", "properties": {"amount": {"$ref": "#/$defs/won"}, "issuedOn": {"$ref": "#/$defs/day"}, "merchant": {"type": "string", "maxLength": 80}, "merchantBizNo": {"$ref": "#/$defs/bizNo"}}}}}}}},
    {"if": {"properties": {"type": {"const": "receipt.chunk"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"body": {"type": "object", "required": ["msgId", "index", "data"], "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"msgId": {"$ref": "#/$defs/ulid"}, "index": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0, "maximum": 127}, "data": {"$ref": "#/$defs/b64", "minLength": 4, "maxLength": 65536, "$comment": "at most chunkSize bytes"}}}}}},
    {"if": {"properties": {"type": {"const": "receipt.ack"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"body": {"type": "object", "required": ["msgId", "state"], "additionalProperties": false, "$comment": "stored: saved on the PC (also for an already-known msgId); the phone deletes its copy. partial: send the listed chunks.", "properties": {"msgId": {"$ref": "#/$defs/ulid"}, "state": {"enum": ["stored", "partial"]}, "missing": {"type": "array", "minItems": 1, "maxItems": 86, "uniqueItems": true, "items": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0, "maximum": 85}}},
      "allOf": [{"if": {"properties": {"state": {"const": "partial"}}}, "then": {"required": ["missing"]}}, {"if": {"properties": {"state": {"const": "stored"}}}, "then": {"not": {"required": ["missing"]}}}]}}}},
